description:
게임 정보
Explore a world filled with unique challenges and obstacles! 💚 In Goo Hunter 💚, you play as a brave Slime treasure hunter who uses her unique abilities to overcome dangerous obstacles and solve intriguing puzzles. With her sticky hands, she skillfully launches herself, uncovering the best path to progress in her adventure.
🧩 Key Features:
Challenging puzzles that test your strategy and precision;
50 handcrafted levels with meticulous attention to detail;

게임 정보
Have you ever dreamed in being a small slime exploring and adventuring through a magical world? Well, your time has come! 
Adventurous Slime is a mini metroidvania about a small but very courageous slime going on an adventure. Featuring a magical world full of dangerous creatures and powerful ancient items to find, colorful pixelated visuals and chiptune songs.
Somebody freed Lord Old Skull and now the little witches are afraid and need a very powerful hero to protect the world! But our slimes don't know any big hero, so they decide to go stop this evil creature by themselves! Why? Well, because they are adventurous slimes!
To finish and/or complete this game it'll probably take around 2/3 hours in most cases, but if you are an experienced metroidvania player, it's possible to finish it in around 1 hour. Also using a controller is highly recommended to playing this game. 
FEATURES
Visit 4 different biomes;
4 bosses to face;
3 Difficulty levels (can be changed at any time);
Customize your slime;
Colorful 8-bit style graphics;
Vibrant Chiptune style music;
Many different Items to collect;
Simplified experience level system;
Alternative paths.

게임 정보
They say that if you want something immensely, it will definitely come true. Those who wish to realize their dream receive a supernatural ability — the way to its fulfillment! A high school student, Tyler discovers such a power in himself: the talent to control the flame, which henceforth serves as his second heart. Meanwhile, it turns out that his friend Jean also has an unusual gift: he can command time. But who are these mysterious ghosts that roam around? Are these persecutions somehow connected with the boys' magic?

Visual novel, adventure, slice of life, fantasy, romance, shounen-ai, comedy, drama, school.

• colorful illustrations;
• romantic scenes;
• original soundtrack;
• dark atmosphere and mysterious plot.

게임 정보
Dangerous Galaxy is a rogue-lite with physics-based combat and extensive ship upgrading, where you explore procedurally generated star systems, manage resources, and fight enemies and boss battles to save the galaxy from evil. 
Extensive ship upgrading system:
Different main weapons that you can choose before each run;
Freedom to add or stack upgrades however you want;
Upgrade leveling - Each active upgrade has an upgrade path that you can choose;
Active abilities - The player can hold 4 active abilities at any time.
Fun physics-based combat:
Every object (including the player) can be pushed away, bumped into or destroyed;
Active abilities (like rockets) can create explosions or gravity-altering effects.

게임 정보
Track Racing: The Holy Rosary is a Catholic game where you race in tracks along the game and play Gervásio (First person) and find the joy of what is being to God (Story Mode). Try to do your best time in Time Attack Mode. Race against other racers in Race mode. And you can race against other players in the World with your friends.
Some Features:
-Drive in First Person (Story Mode);
-Time Attack (3rd Person);
-Quick Race Mode (3rd Person);
-Multiplayer Mode (3rd Person);
Coming 2025 :)

게임 정보
Samael, the friendly reaper of souls, tells his adventures with his friends and co-workers. Discover other points of view in the story of The Death Into Trouble, unlock the bestiary of creatures from beyond and other original stories.
Features
3 books with mini tales from The Death Universe;
More than 30 unique hand-drawn illustrations;
A clever mix of visual novel and puzzle;
With the narrative language of motion comics;

게임 정보
Samael, the friendly reaper of souls, tells his adventures with his friends and co-workers. Discover other points of view in the story of The Death Into Trouble, unlock the bestiary of creatures from beyond and other original stories.
Features
3 books with mini tales from The Death Universe;
More than 30 unique hand-drawn illustrations;
A clever mix of visual novel and puzzle;
With the narrative language of motion comics;

게임 정보
Match two identical monsters hiding inside tombstones to score points and unleash powerful monster effects upon your enemy, for example if you match two Eternal Weavers you will slow your enemy speed by 30% for 6 seconds!
Match all of your monster pairs before your enemy does and get awesome rewards!
Battle in three game modes:
* Prove your worth in fast-paced PvP battles against players around the world;
* Conquer the Campaign mode and find unique challenges and rewards within;

게임 정보
Quadrofriend - is a horror story in the walking simulator genre. The game features puzzles, Easter eggs, item searching, a quest system, references to movies and games, enemies you need to run away from, a well-developed story in the form of notes, dialogues between the protagonist and the antagonist.
Quadrofriend - will introduce you to the fascinating yet grim story of two old friends. To survive and return home, the protagonist must go through all the trials that his friend Jacob has prepared for him.
Features:
Walking simulator genre;
Tense atmosphere;
3D surround sound;
Realistic graphics;
Puzzles:
The game features various types of puzzles, from ordinary item searches and film references to logic tests.

게임 정보
1) 이것은 조작이 간단하고, 사격이 쾌적하며, 전투가 격렬한 비행 사격 게임입니다;
2) 30개의 스토리 챕터가 있으며, "뚱뚱한 새"와 평행 세계에서 온 "우리" 사이의 전쟁 이야기를 담고 있습니다. 스토리 모드에서 거의 30시간의 게임 플레이 시간을 제공합니다;
3) 30개의 지형이 각기 다른 3d장면에서 강력한 화력을 통해 적과 방어, 공격, 호송, 수색, 사냥, 보호, 쟁탈, 구출, 추격, 저격 등 10여 가지 유형의 임무를 수행하는 전투;
4) 2가지 게임 모드 선택 가능, 줄거리 모드, 방어 모드, 적은 모두 대량의 무작위 진입 방식을 채택하여 매번 통관마다 도전을 가지게 한다;
5) 30여종의 부동한 류형의 차량, 비행기, 군함함, 10여종의 부동한 류형의 화력탑.게임의 플레이를 재미있고 풍부하게 만드는 10 가지 이상의 기지;
6) 플레이어는 3 가지 다른 유형의 무기, 5 가지 다른 유형의 화력 지원, 1 대의 화력이 강한 요기, 1 개의 이동 가능한 지상 기동 부대가 플레이어에게 강력한 화력 출력을 제공합니다;
7) 강력한 화력 출력, 화력 지원으로 인한 시원시원한 화력 제압으로 전투에서의 즐거움을 만끽;
8) 12개의 방어 퀘스트, 무료 업데이트 지속.

게임 정보
1) 이것은 조작이 간단하고, 사격이 쾌적하며, 전투가 격렬한 비행 사격 게임입니다;
2) 30개의 스토리 챕터가 있으며, "뚱뚱한 새"와 평행 세계에서 온 "우리" 사이의 전쟁 이야기를 담고 있습니다. 스토리 모드에서 거의 30시간의 게임 플레이 시간을 제공합니다;
3) 30개의 지형이 각기 다른 3d장면에서 강력한 화력을 통해 적과 방어, 공격, 호송, 수색, 사냥, 보호, 쟁탈, 구출, 추격, 저격 등 10여 가지 유형의 임무를 수행하는 전투;
4) 2가지 게임 모드 선택 가능, 줄거리 모드, 방어 모드, 적은 모두 대량의 무작위 진입 방식을 채택하여 매번 통관마다 도전을 가지게 한다;
5) 30여종의 부동한 류형의 차량, 비행기, 군함함, 10여종의 부동한 류형의 화력탑.게임의 플레이를 재미있고 풍부하게 만드는 10 가지 이상의 기지;
6) 플레이어는 3 가지 다른 유형의 무기, 5 가지 다른 유형의 화력 지원, 1 대의 화력이 강한 요기, 1 개의 이동 가능한 지상 기동 부대가 플레이어에게 강력한 화력 출력을 제공합니다;
7) 강력한 화력 출력, 화력 지원으로 인한 시원시원한 화력 제압으로 전투에서의 즐거움을 만끽;
8) 12개의 방어 퀘스트, 무료 업데이트 지속.

게임 정보
Dash, shoot and strike in this lightning-paced hack n' slash roguelike set in a gothic, undying world!

Focused on movement abilities, split-second decision-making and stylish strings of attacks, Bloodrush encourages a creative approach to combat, combining abilities to demolish your foes!
A DANCE OF CARNAGE
String together new combos by combining weapon attacks with movement abilities;
Always have a chance to come back - rush to recover health by executing enemies;
Vary weapons and kill quickly to gain Style and recover more health.

THE CULT OF ETERNITY
A variety of enemies and bosses stand in the way of Death's liberation, forming the Cult of Eternity;
Dance in eight combat arenas, each with different mechanics and challenges to interact with;
Sharpen a different build every run with diverse weapon combinations, abilities and upgrades.

게임 정보
Many Things Can Change After A Trauma.

For Nathan, the way he saw the world was affected after being shot in a robbery. When he acquires a new skill, he finds himself immersed in a sucession of events that, one by one, shakes the pillars of his already fragile life.
Technical Facts
Multiple endings: your choices matter;
About 5 hours of gameplay;
15+ backgrounds and 15+ CGs;
20+ original songs.

게임 정보
A SPACE ADVENTURE

Anny K. and her robot Droid 07 were kidnapped and locked in different rooms inside a ship controlled by DreX Androids. What they don't know is that anyone has a device to control the Droid 07 remotely and can recognize it to escape back to their planet. In this adventure, help Droid 07 to overcome challenges, discover mysteries and free your friend from the miniaigas.

A PUZZLE GAME FULL OF CHALLENGES

• The game has a progression system for the character
main Droid 07 that unlocks new abilities as the
player advances through levels;
• More than 40 levels in 4 different worlds;
• Coin system that, when collected, unlock phases
bonus;
• 2 playable characters;
• Great sound effects, exciting story and music tracks
exciting to keep the player fully immersed in the Game;
• Beautiful retro graphics in pixel art style, rescuing a nostalgia for
old games

게임 정보


Organize by rotating ink-filled stamps to form beautiful shapes,
When completing the puzzle the stamp is pressed on the paper, printing your watercolor painting!

Features:
30 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack composed especially to help you relax;
Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;
Beautiful hand-drawn watercolor art.

게임 정보

Clock Overwhelmed is a game that brings criticism to modern times, in which you have more and more tasks to do and you have to solve a real puzzle to try to fit all your activities.

Shoot all tasks in the blank spaces of your watch,
without overlapping any activity!
Features:
30 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack composed especially to help you stay immersed in the game;
Addictive gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual action games;
Beautiful Lowpoly art style.

게임 정보


In each level, you must locate and synchronize a constellation, using the instruments and information offered by the software. Use the data and tools in your advantage, explore and gather information for the database.
resources
Identify and synchronize more than 40 constellations;
Atmospheric soundtrack and SFX to help you immerse in the game;
Beautiful technological space art;

게임 정보
Use the rules of the famous Tower of Hanoi puzzle,
where a larger piece cannot be on top of a smaller one.

Every move the piece Spins clockwise changing its pattern,
in most of the cases you have to do one or more extra moves to get the right pattern when stacking.
Features:
50 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack inspired by Synthwave classics and some cyberpunk touches;
Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;
Beautiful futuristic art.

게임 정보
In the game, players will face various challenges and obstacles, and need to solve puzzles, explore and fight to continuously improve their spiritual cultivation. Players can communicate with other living beings, learn the wisdom of ancient immortal cultivation legends and explore the mysteries of ascension. At the same time, players can also collect elixirs, spirit stones and other treasures in the game to enhance their abilities and cultivation in order to better pursue the path of ascension.

1、Open world with multiple floating islands;
2、Multiplayer co-op (10-30 players) , you can explore alone or adventure and fight with your buddies;
3, Ground combat as well as air fights, etc. You can also build your own territory on land;
